claims:
1. A system for producing web content keyword search results having associated rank scores based on external, social reference data, comprising:
a web server on which is operating a web content keyword search engine; a reference counter for maintaining a count of the number of social references made to an item of content; a user interface to said search engine for receiving a web keyword search request; a processor programmed to:
receive said request and in response thereto access said web server to execute said search request;
receive in response to said search request an identification of one or more items of content, at least one of said items of content being the subject of a count of the number of social references to said item of content as maintained by said reference counter;
determine, for each said item of content which is the subject of a count of the number of social references, a social reference ranking factor at least in part as a function of the count of social references to said content;
associate said items of content with the corresponding said social reference ranking factor; and
provide said items of content with an associated social reference ranking factor for display as the results of said web content keyword search.
